OL,3,ABBC upholds complaints over Victoria
OL,4,ABeckham slur on Have I Got News For You
OL,5,
OL,6,FComplaints about the broadcast of a
OL,7,Fswear word in connection with Victoria
OL,8,FBeckham during an episode of BBC One's
OL,9,FHave I Got News For You have been
OL,10,Fupheld, the corporation's executive
OL,11,Fcomplaints unit (ECU) has ruled.
OL,13,FThe show, from 7 November last year,
OL,14,Fhosted by comic and presenter Katherine
OL,15,FRyan, featured an email allegedly sent
OL,16,Fby Sir David Beckham in which the word
OL,17,Fwas used.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
